Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A warm home where I can stay out of the rain. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.03,0:00:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And now I've got a fluffy mattress... 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Candy in the bottle, too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow I feel so satisfied. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't feel satisfied just having one or two! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At that rate it'll take you 100 years to fill the bottle! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine, Ioryogi. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.23,0:00:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it takes 100 years, I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.51,0:00:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You think I'll put up with you for 100 years? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You understand what you need to do, right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heal scarred hearts, and collect candy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The birdies are singing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The morning dew glints off the flowers. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It smells great. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You see so much when you wake up early. 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Going for a walk softening you up? 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, what a wonderful path!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's so pretty. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you crying? 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because... the foliage is so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You cry because the foliage is pretty? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.78,0:04:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, who are you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Hanato Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kohaku. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.52,0:04:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, you've got to keep pretending you're a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku, Kohaku from Heaven? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heaven? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You smelled different than the other passersby. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is this? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay in front of her. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? I've heard that name somewhere. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you!? Not Ioryogi, a name just like it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.57,0:05:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A name just like it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps you're Iorogi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You two know each other? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just by name. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect {\i1}the{\i0}  Iorogi to be this cute. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, this body is just... 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going by Ioryogi for now. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, then. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're Kobato. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to finish watering the trees in the garden before the sunlight gets too strong. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you scared me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm looking at the leaves. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how long I look, I can't cry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno. But looking at them makes me want to cry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Tell me why. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The guy who was supposed to help is slacking off, so I'm gonna be picking them up all day. That makes me want to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it! I'll get it done in a flash! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help out, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help too! 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know why Kohaku was crying. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I find out, then maybe I can heal her. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think you'll get it just looking at those... 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But maybe I'll get some kind of hint. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Figured. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I guess I have to wake up early and go ask Kohaku again. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I overslept! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.35,0:07:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saw that coming. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see you worked hard today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kohaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:07:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.90,0:08:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be such a wet rag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A wet rag?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'd just get in the way if you showed up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can just wait at home rather than tracking me down in the street. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But walking home with you like this makes me happy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus it lets me be with you a little longer. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.35,0:08:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, they're flirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Such a wonderful house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll never have one like it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not even supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rich doesn't mean her heart works different from everyone else's. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where'd you get that one from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By reading the magazines at the convenience store! 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When should I approach her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I couldn't keep our appointment today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just pulled an all-nighter, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, your patients are the most important thing. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're important too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it. We're not supposed to be here, Kobato. Let's go home. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O spirit which sleeps within water, heed my call. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rain down over the trees, giving your strength, 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and gather to save those lives. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fall, o rain of blessings!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so pretty. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm friggin' soaked now! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really, I'm sorry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. Sorry for just coming in uninvited. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest... 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I saw you with a man yesterday. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for following you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know why you cried. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I was really curious. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really understand it myself. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But when I see something beautiful I want to show it to Shuichiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It reminds me of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I think of Shuichiro, I... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you think of him? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My heart aches... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It aches?{oh sfxwords how i loathe you} 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It makes me feel gloomy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Remembering how satisfied I feel when I'm by his side. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Remembering that shy smile of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All those memories wash over me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I start crying just like that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I can't explain it very well. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So love makes you miserable, makes you want to cry!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Love? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.67,0:12:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Love, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, it's love. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And here you said you didn't get it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The magazines said that love makes you worry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you having any problems, Kohaku? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The problem is that Shuichiro is always so busy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've never even gone on a date. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A date? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's when you go with someone you like to an amusement park or something. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd make me so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A date at an amusement park? 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me, Kohaku! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she can go with Shuichiro to an amusement park, 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku's heart will be healed. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First, I've got to check out parks! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.07,0:13:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So this is an amusement park. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks so fun. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tickets are ￥3,000!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, amusement parks are pricy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm broke. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you should focus on actually healing Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Ioryogi! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:13:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First prize, a trip to Hawaii! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Second prize, an onsen vacation! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Third prize, amusement park tickets! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spin the handle, and see what color ball you get! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All prizes are for two! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Step right up to the lotto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.99,0:14:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wonderful! It looks like they're giving away tickets to that amusement park! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your ticket, young lady? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't have a ticket you can't play. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I need a lotto ticket before I can get an amusement park ticket... 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A lotto ticket...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.51,0:14:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't be depressed about it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to remember Kohaku. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't calm down about the ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you so disappointed for? 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, there's no way one would just drop out of the{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A lotto ticket! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's my lotto ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me spin it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.01,0:15:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope I get a ticket...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations, you win! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.55,0:15:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? I got something? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fifth prize! A stuffed crocodile! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take good care of it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's just a booby prize! 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you turn it down!? 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's rude to turn down something given so kindly. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I need amusement park tickets. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You again? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.99,0:16:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit zoning out! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you delivering newspapers? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Miss Sayaka said you delivered pizza. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.91,0:16:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I do that too. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have that many jobs? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that? 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.09,0:16:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A crocodile I won. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's not what I really needed. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:16:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Amusement park tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I got them at work. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.77,0:17:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have these tickets? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you that stupid? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about if I trade you the crocodile? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way. I don't even need it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then Kohaku will be able to go on a date there. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now Shuichiro will go on a date with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just do whatever. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with those newspapers? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm helping deliver them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.97,0:18:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're delivering newspapers to get those tickets? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Here. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. But I can't take them. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro is so busy that we'd never get the chance to use them. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You worked so hard for them that I don't want them to go to waste... 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it! Kobato, you go! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, take Ioryogi. 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.81,0:18:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take Ioryogi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't even think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! You've got to go with Shuichiro! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.23,0:19:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't think I'll be able to. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't want to be selfish. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it selfish? 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When Shuichiro is with you, he seems so happy. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you're as dear to him as he is to you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know he'll go on the date. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.63,0:19:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato... 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro. 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.41,0:19:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have those tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! Here you go! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro... Can we go together? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind ferris wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't see them anymore. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! Let's go home. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay... 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they're having fun. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.07,0:21:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's a messenger from Heaven. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heaven? Another friend of yours? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A time limit? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Having to fill the bottle before the four seasons pass, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You heard, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, about the time limit. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got four seasons, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Meaning you need to fill the bottle within a year. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.52,0:21:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll never be able to go to that place. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, what's in there? 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There aren't any more. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand why? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.41,0:22:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.39,0:22:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I heal Kohaku? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before that. People who're already happy don't need to be healed. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Meaning she wasn't hurt. 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.43,0:22:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nothing to be glad about!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,100 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,100 points? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.21,0:22:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Minus! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.32,0:22:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Minus 100 points? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.63,0:22:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You picked the wrong person. That's enough for someone who can't understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm glad I made her so happy! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so optimistic! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got one year! Get to work! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.83,0:22:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I'll try my best! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop making that face! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of face should I make when I get to work? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.61,0:22:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this, if you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.07,0:00:52.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:01:01.24,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:11.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:16.84,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:24.60,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:30.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.27,0:01:35.49,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:41.78,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:47.46,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:54.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:02:02.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(918,1001)\pos(424,166)}... Pulsing leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:07.90,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.57,0:23:15.41,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.99,0:23:23.42,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:32.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.39,0:23:43.06,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:45.77,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:54.20,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:24:01.29,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:10.80,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.88,0:24:14.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:28.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.10,0:24:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(540,388)}... Hotaru's promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.10,0:24:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(538,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.69,0:22:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
